    {"[head=2][color=goldenrod]Operational Directive[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bold]To:[/bold] [italic]Commanding Officer, UNS Almayer[/italic]"}
    {"[bold]From:[/bold] [bold]REGIMENTAL COMMAND - CHINOOK 91 GSO STATION[/bold]"}
    {"[bold]Subject:[/bold] Operational Objectives - Hybrisa Prospera AO"}
    {"[bold]Reference:[/bold] 48-77-AQ"}
    {"[bold]Classification:[/bold] [color=#cb0000][bold]CONFIDENTIAL[/bold][/color]"}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"Commander,"}

    {"You are tasked with responding to a complete communications blackout from Hybrisa Prospera, a major colony on LV-759 with a population in the tens of thousands."}

    {"The colony hosts critical mineral refining infrastructure, a major spaceport, and is a key transit hub for the Neroid Sector."}

    {"UNMC intervention was requested jointly by the Three World Empire and Weston-Yamada following the sudden loss of all contact with planetary authorities."}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"[head=3][color=#8c0000]Primary Objectives[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bullet]Establish a secure Forward Operating Base near the central transit loop and spaceport junction."}
    {"[bullet]Locate and recover key government, security, and medical personnel from the city center and outlying medical complex."}
    {"[bullet]Secure classified Weston-Yamada research data and prevent its exfiltration by third parties."}

    {"[head=3][color=#134975]Secondary Objectives[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bullet]Restore control over city-wide power and traffic systems via transit control or engineering hubs."}
    {"[bullet]Investigate rumors of a buried alien structure south of the colony. Initiate recon but avoid deep penetration without support."}
    {"[bullet]Neutralize or detain any paramilitary elements operating in the city's lower districts or corporate zones."}

    {"Tread carefully. This is a population center and political flashpoint."}
    {"Collateral damage must be minimized where feasible."}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"Signed,"}
    {"[color=#dfc189][bolditalic]Second Lieutenant Lucas Harlan[/bolditalic][/color]"}
    {"[italic]Strategic Liaison Officer | 2nd Battalion, 3rd Regiment - 4th Combat Division[/italic]"}
    {"[color=#AAAAAA][italic]For the Corps.[/italic][/color]"}

    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
