    {"[head=2][color=goldenrod]Operational Directive[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bold]To:[/bold] [italic]Commanding Officer, UNS Almayer[/italic]"}
    {"[bold]From:[/bold] [bold]SECTOR ENFORCEMENT CENTER - FORT THUNDER, TRAPPIST-5[/bold]"}
    {"[bold]Subject:[/bold] Engagement Protocol - Hybrisa Prospera AO"}
    {"[bold]Reference:[/bold] 48-77-SE"}
    {"[bold]Classification:[/bold] [color=#cb0000][bold]CONFIDENTIAL[/bold][/color]"}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"Commander,"}

    {"Hybrisa Prospera was lost under suspicious conditions immediately following the withdrawal of TWE forces."}

    {"Intelligence suggests enemy contact may have coincided with — or been accelerated by — covert corporate operations. This is now a hostile urban AO. Your task is to take control of the situation before the Empire or any other power can intervene further."}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"[head=3][color=#8c0000]Primary Objectives[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bullet]Fortify FOB at a location which gives direct access to high-density civilian zones and corporate infrastructure."}
    {"[bullet]Eliminate suspected infestations or dangerous non-human elements in sub-city transit tunnels, sewer grids, or excavation sites near the xenocraft chamber."}
    {"[bullet]Seize and lock down all Weston-Yamada blacksite facilities — detain or eliminate PMC personnel."}

    {"[head=3][color=#134975]Secondary Objectives[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bullet]Prevent exfil of sensitive tech or bioweapons to off-world smugglers via the starport."}
    {"[bullet]Establish control over Hybrisa's planetary defense uplink and secure TWE depot bunkers."}
    {"[bullet]Apprehend or neutralize known CLF agitators operating in the worker districts."}

    {"This is no longer a city. It's a contested battlespace."}
    {"Secure it - fast, hard, and without ambiguity."}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"Signed,"}
    {"[color=#dfc189][bolditalic]Colonel Margaret A.W. Shanks[/bolditalic][/color]"}
    {"[italic]United Nations Marine Corps | Colonial Protection Organization - 4th Combat Division[/italic]"}
    {"[color=#AAAAAA][italic]No mercy. No doubt.[/italic][/color]"}

    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
