    {"[head=2][color=goldenrod]Operational Directive[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bold]To:[/bold] [italic]Commanding Officer, UNS Almayer[/italic]"}
    {"[bold]From:[/bold] [bold]TECHNICAL OPERATIONS DIRECTORATE - ANVIL STATION, HERCULINA ORBIT[/bold]"}
    {"[bold]Subject:[/bold] Research-Oriented Objectives - Hybrisa Prospera AO"}
    {"[bold]Reference:[/bold] 48-77-RI"}
    {"[bold]Classification:[/bold] [color=#cb0000][bold]CONFIDENTIAL[/bold][/color]"}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"Commander,"}

    {"Hybrisa Prospera sits atop the most extensive alien structure discovery since the Derelict on LV-426."}

    {"Intelligence confirms that Weston-Yamada was conducting unauthorized excavation beneath the colony with multiple layered facilities of unknown origin."}

    {"This is a high-priority recovery operation for advanced xeno-technology."}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"[head=3][color=#8c0000]Primary Objectives[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bullet]Secure a FOB near corporate transit lines and excavation zone entry."}
    {"[bullet]Recover all data cores from Weston-Yamada's underground research chambers."}
    {"[bullet]Tag and document any evidence of the xenocraft's internal structure. Avoid triggering automated systems."}

    {"[head=3][color=#134975]Secondary Objectives[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bullet]Obtain DNA or biomechanical samples from Whiteguard containment facilities."}
    {"[bullet]Preserve advanced medical AI housed in the city's neurological hospital."}
    {"[bullet]Trace possible anomalous activity vectors using biometric traffic logs from spaceport scanners."}

    {"Do not allow this discovery to vanish in fire and bullets."}
    {"The future of humanity may rest here."}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"Signed,"}
    {"[color=#dfc189][bolditalic]Lt. Colonel Geoffrey Lamdem[/bolditalic][/color]"}
    {"[italic]Division Logistics Commander | Military Organization for Development and Innovation - 4th Combat Division[/italic]"}
    {"[color=#AAAAAA][italic]Onward through progress.[/italic][/color]"}

